---
description: Map recorded historical place expressions to boundaries effective in their source period.
args: { dossier: LinkageDossier; change: LinkageChange }
returns: HistoricalPlace[]
---
Preserve every source place name and historical boundary. Use geography sources effective for the relevant time period. Keep all plausible jurisdiction candidates when boundaries changed or names were reused. Never collapse a historic place to its modern successor without an explicit relationship record.
